rgwtrace is built on top of the cephtrace project:

    https://github.com/taodd/cephtrace

by Dongdong Tao and contributors. Its BPF tracing code and DWARF
probe-extraction approach are derived from the cephtrace/radostrace
tracing implementation.

Ceph is developed by the Ceph authors and contributors. The derived
BPF files in `bpf/` are distributed under GPL-2.0-only with SPDX headers.

In accordance with the GPL-2.0 license of the upstream cephtrace work,
rgwtrace as a whole is distributed under GPL-2.0-only. The full project
license text is available in `LICENSE.GPL-2.0`.
